              "text": "obtain (specific restriction endonuclease) gene, qualified <b>; </b><br>e.g. gene extracted from the, DNA / genome, of E. coli / bacteria<br>gene synthesised from the mRNA of E. coli / bacteria<br>gene synthesised from nucleotides"
            },
            {
              "n": 2,
              "text": "PCR to make more copies of, gene / DNA <b>; </b>"
            },
